source.description:
A use-dull and finger-smudged knife folds in on itself.

{{rules|Strength Bonus Cap: 3
Weapon Class: Short Blades (causes bleeding on critical hit)}}
{{cyan|Painted: This item is painted with a scene from the life of the ancient sultan {{magenta|Orohim}}:

Deep in the wilds of the Historians' District of Biwan, Orohim discovered the Shrine at Birsilil. There he befriended oozes and fought for everlasting glory.}}

{{rules|+50 reputation with the Burgundy Sorrow of Daarramrod Brood}}

